@startuml
title Fund Transfer Flow

actor "Customer\n(Frontend)" as C
participant "API Gateway\n:8080" as GW
participant "Transaction Service\n:8083" as TS
participant "Account Service\n:8082" as AS
participant "Kafka\n(Upstash)" as K
participant "Audit Service\n:8084" as AU
participant "Notification Service\n:8085" as NS

C -> GW: POST /api/v1/transactions/transfer\n{senderAccountId, receiverAccountId, amount, currency}\nAuthorization: Bearer <JWT>
GW -> TS: Validate JWT + route to transaction-service

note over TS: Saga Step 1
TS -> TS: Create Transaction record\nstatus: PENDING

note over TS,AS: Saga Step 2 — service JWT (ROLE_ADMIN)
TS -> AS: GET /api/v1/accounts/{senderAccountId}/balance
AS --> TS: 200 OK {balance: 50000.00 NGN}

note over TS,AS: Saga Step 3 — debit sender
TS -> AS: POST /api/v1/accounts/{senderAccountId}/debit\n{amount: 1000.00, currency: NGN}
AS --> TS: 200 OK — debit successful

note over TS,AS: Saga Step 4 — credit receiver
TS -> AS: POST /api/v1/accounts/{receiverAccountId}/credit\n{amount: 1000.00, currency: NGN}
AS --> TS: 200 OK — credit successful

note over TS: Saga Step 5
TS -> TS: Update Transaction status → SUCCESS

note over TS,NS: Async — fire and forget
TS -> K: Publish TRANSACTION_CREATED\ntopic: transaction-events
K -> AU: Consume TRANSACTION_CREATED\nWrite immutable audit log
K -> NS: Consume TRANSACTION_CREATED\nSend email/SMS alert to customer

TS --> GW: 201 CREATED {transactionId, status: SUCCESS, amount: 1000.00 NGN}
GW --> C: 201 CREATED

note over TS: ⚠ Compensation: If credit fails after debit\n→ compensating credit back to sender\n→ Transaction marked FAILED
@enduml